Complete UI reconstruction specification — Farm Conditions dashboard
Scope: This description covers exclusively the foreground user interface: card positioning, dimensions, layout, alignment, spacing, internal content, borders, transparency, gradients, glass effects, typography, icons, and component proportions.

The background photograph is excluded entirely. All measurements refer to the supplied 1820 × 818 px reference image. Coordinates are approximate pixel measurements, with (0,0) at the top-left corner.

The interface consists of three major visual structures:
1. A large Farm Conditions dashboard card on the upper-left.
2. A separate All Fields card on the upper-right.
3. A long horizontal Weather card beneath both upper cards.
The overall composition is a floating, three-panel dashboard. The upper two cards sit side by side, while the weather panel spans almost the entire width underneath them.

