14. Precise internal spacing and alignment rules
The three cards must look like one cohesive dashboard.

Their internal padding and alignments should be consistent.
Element	Horizontal spacing	Vertical spacing
Farm logo → title	24 px	Centered
Header title → subtitle	0 px	4 px
Gauge → chart	30–40 px	Aligned to same content region
Banner icon → text	23 px	Centered
Banner text lines	0 px	4 px
All Fields icon → heading	15 px	Centered
Thumbnail → field information	20–23 px	Centered
Field title → status	10 px	Same row
Title → health details	8–10 px	Vertical
Health details → progress bar	16 px	Vertical
Weather icon → text	22 px	Centered
Weather section → divider	20–25 px	Centered
Divider → next icon	20–24 px	Centered

Important: Use align-items: center for the internal horizontal groups. Do not independently position each icon and text element with arbitrary top coordinates. Use flexbox and grid so that their relationships remain consistent.

