16. Final positioning and visual fidelity requirements
These are the most important implementation details to preserve.
Priority	Requirement
1	The two upper panels must have identical top and bottom alignment.
2	Farm Conditions must be substantially wider than All Fields.
3	All Fields must contain exactly three vertically stacked field cards.
4	The circular 92% gauge must sit on the left side of Farm Conditions.
5	The analytics graph must occupy the right side of the main card.
6	The success notification must span the lower width of Farm Conditions.
7	Weather must be one continuous full-width card underneath the upper panels.
8	Weather must have four horizontal information sections.
9	The three upper-level cards must use consistent luminous glass styling.
10	The inner field cards must look slightly more raised and brighter than their parent container.

